ighting, smooth motion, high definition, 4k, realistic skin texture, cinematic quality.\n\n#### 版本 2：简洁动态指令（适用于 Runway Gen-2 / Pika）\n> **Prompt:** The woman in the red top turns her head, smiles brightly at the camera, and speaks naturally. She gestures with her hand and laughs. The cat in the background remains still. Soft lighting, realistic human movement, high quality.\n\n#### 版本 3：针对表情与细节（侧重情感表达）\n> **Prompt:** Close up of a girl in glasses talking and laughing, vivid facial expressions, lip-sync, she is gesturing with her hand, red top, laptop and coffee on the table, a cat on the sofa behind her, cozy atmosphere, realistic video style.\n\n---\n\n### 使用建议：\n*   **控制变量**：在生成时，如果工具支持“运动强度”（Motion Brush 或 Motion Bucket），建议设置在中等程度（4-6），以保持人物动作的自然，避免身体发生过度扭曲。\n*   **负面提示词 (Negative Prompt)**：如果可以输入，建议加入 `deformed, blurred, extra fingers, messy hair, distorted face, low quality`。\n*   **首尾帧控制**：如果您使用的工具支持首尾帧（如 Kling），建议将视频的第一帧和最后一帧分别设为她“托腮思考”和“微笑回头”的瞬间，效果会更好。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 62, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [363.40521240234375, 743.1055908203125], "pos": [289.8752136230469, 432.5977783203125], "id": 60, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "groupNodes": {"视频信息": {"external": [[8, 0, "STRING"]], "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 194.5454559326172], "pos": [-1050, 0], "widgets_values": ["这是一个10秒的视频"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "index": 0, "id": -1, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "o